eady a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":211807,"global_rank":274723,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46127},{"name":"humbleOldSage/Post-Training-Quantisation-for-Image-Dataset","owner":"humbleOldSage","html_url":"https://github.com/humbleOldSage/Post-Training-Quantisation-for-Image-Dataset","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211804,"global_rank":274731,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46128},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":211801,"global_rank":274749,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46129},{"name":"mattcwilde/vetrr","owner":"mattcwilde","html_url":"https://github.com/mattcwilde/vetrr","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"GUI to vet the cgm-squared redrock galaxy redshifts","topics":[],"score":211800,"global_rank":308051,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46130},{"name":"KanhaKorgaonkar/north-korea","owner":"KanhaKorgaonkar","html_url":"https://github.com/KanhaKorgaonkar/north-korea","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211793,"global_rank":274767,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46131},{"name":"supriyak21/LangChain-WebRAG","owner":"supriyak21","html_url":"https://github.com/supriyak21/LangChain-WebRAG","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Web RAG using Langchain ","topics":[],"score":211793,"global_rank":274774,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46132},{"name":"veeragoni/dbrx-to-oci-atp","owner":"veeragoni","html_url":"